@startuml "[Activity] VITA Reserve - Cancel Appointment"
skinparam ConditionEndStyle hline
title "[Activity] Cancel Appointment"

|Client or\nSched. Part.|
start
:<b>Client Input Steps</b>
* Full Name
* Phone Number
* ZipCode;
:Submits for retrieval.;
note right
    **JSON Payload**
    <font:monospaced>
    {
        "full_name":
            "Jane Doe",
        "phone_number": 
            "1234567890",
        "zip_code": 
            "12345"
    }
end note

|System|
:Find appointment by\nprovided details.;
if (Appointment exists\nunder received details) then (No) 
    |Client or\nSched. Part.|
    :Alert user no\nappointment was found.;
    stop
else (Yes)
endif

|System|
if (Is Appointment upcoming?) then (No)
    |Client or\nSched. Part.|
    :Alert user no\nupcoming appointment.;
    stop
else (Yes)
endif

|Client or\nSched. Part.|
:Alert user upcoming appointment was found.;
:Ask user to confirm deletion.;

|System|
if (User confirms Deletion) then (No)
    |Client or\nSched. Part.|
    :Alert user no\naction taken.;
    stop
else (Yes)
endif
|System|
:Process cancellation.;
:Return result;

|Client or\nSched. Part.|
if (Cancellation Result) then (Success)
    :Alert user cancellation\nwas successful.;
else (Unsuccessful)
    :Alert user cancellation\nwas unsuccessful.;
endif

end
footer Sched. Part. = Scheduling Partner
@enduml